  "body": "Well Maintained And Presented, With No Major Work Required To Make The Home Comfortable And Ready For Its Next Chapter!\r\n\r\n* Well-Presented 3-Bedroom Home – A comfortable and practical family home offering three bedrooms, a functional layout, and plenty of potential for its new location.\r\n* Classic Weatherboard Construction – Featuring attractive weatherboard cladding, this home offers a timeless look and a proven construction style well suited to relocation.\r\n* Functional & Practical Layout – The home provides a well-balanced floor plan with good use of space, making it an easy and practical option for a wide range of buyers.\r\n* Nice Condition Throughout – Well maintained and presented in nice condition, with no major work required to make the home comfortable and ready for its next chapter.\r\n* A Great Relocatable Opportunity – Combining three bedrooms, practical living spaces, weatherboard construction, and easy one-piece relocation, this is a solid opportunity for anyone looking for a quality home to relocate.\r\n\r\nThe selling price includes:\r\n\r\nOur Relocation Package onto an easy access flat site within 100kms of its current location\r\nStandard NZS3604 timber foundations\r\nGST\r\nThe final price is subject to a destination site inspection and does not include any council fees.\r\n\r\nPlease call Myles on 022 657 5070 to arrange a time to view or to find out more about purchasing this house for shifting to your section.\r\n\r\n*Please note depending on the level of interest, the sale of this house may go to a multi offer.\r\n\r\n* Do you need help with Consents, Building Plans, Draughting & Design? Our team can help! Give us a call on 0508 4 RELOCATE (473 562) to book a FREE 20-min consultation with our Design Manager for expert advice on your next project.\r\n* Any other questions? Give us a call on 0508 4 RELOCATE (0508 473 562) to find out how we can help.\r\n\r\nKey Words: transportable, house for relocation, transportable home, relocatable house, renovate, house for removal, building for removal",
